te. A retry completed the rollback to us-west and eu-west. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n3. **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) documenting the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and follow-ups. The create call timed out, so I verified via `list_incidents` that it had actually been created rather than re-sending and risking a duplicate page.\n\n**Recommended follow-ups** (noted in the incident): root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before any redeploy, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}